         self-intersecting). The middle slider is shortened, its red
         "handle" dot separated by the same gap as between the three
         bars, and the dot's own right edge lines up with the two long
         bars' right edge. Sized to sit comfortably inside the ~66dp
         safe zone every launcher mask respects, rather than pushed out
         to its very edge. -->
